%\item[{(multiedges)}] For every $j\in[m]$, let $value_j$ be a map that associates to each node labelled with $x_i$, with $i\in[n]$, the constant $a_{i,j}$, and to each node labelled $b_j$ the constant $-b_j$; $value_j$ is undefined otherwise.
