The structural hint broke the 32-bit rung, but the one allowed move to 44-bit values held against all three hinted vendors. I have promoted exactly that rung to `hard` and measured a worst-case 721-character/181-token answer over 2,000 shipping seeds. I’m now rerunning the bare, script-owned hardening loop with the revised named ladder, as G9 requires after the move.
