The final bare 44-bit vendor eventually solved, despite the separate hinted sample holding—sample variation across the four-vendor pool. Therefore 44 bits cannot ship under STEP 4. The main harness has automatically escalated, at fixed 48-element length, to 56-bit values; I’ll let it determine whether that rung holds, then the final shipping rung must receive its own hinted test.
