The final deliverables are written and the temporary hardening directories have been moved to trash after their transcripts were copied back. The README now includes the exact demo rendering, all measured gates, the full bare oracle ladder, the incomplete-placebo disclosure, and the central caveat: this is a near-cap arithmetic Track B benchmark, not average-case ILP hardness. I’m doing one final independent interface/transcript audit now.
